  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n8-17-35\n\n2 × (__**17 - 8)**__ = __**35 - 17**__\n\n__**2 × 9**__ = 18\n\n18 = 18 (LHS = RHS) \n\nAnd,\n\n23-47-95\n\n2 × (__47 - 23)__ = __95 - 47__\n\n__2 × 24__ = 48\n\n48 = 48 (LHS = RHS) \n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 9-20-41\n\n2 × (__20 - 9)__ = __41 - 20__\n\n__2 × 11__ = 21\n\n22 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 12-25-51\n\n2 × (__25 - 12)__ = __51 - 25__\n\n__2 × 13__ = 26\n\n**26 = 26 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) 13-29-55\n\n2 × __**(29** - 13)__ = __55 - 29__\n\n__2 × 16__ = 26\n\n32 ≠ 26 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 16-32-62\n\n2 × __**(**32 - 16)__ = __62 - 32__\n\n__2 × 16__ = 30\n\n32 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '12-25-51' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
